<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

<h3>1.1 Personal Information</h3>
<p>When you visit our Site or make a purchase, we may collect the following types of personal information:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Identity Data:</strong> First name, last name, username, or similar identifier.</li>
  <li><strong>Contact Data:</strong> Email address, telephone number, billing address, and shipping address.</li>
  <li><strong>Financial Data:</strong> Payment card information (processed securely through Shopify Payments, Shop Pay, or PayPal). We never store raw credit card numbers on our servers.</li>
  <li><strong>Transaction Data:</strong> Details about purchases, orders, returns, and exchanges.</li>
  <li><strong>Profile Data:</strong> Your account username and password, purchase history, and preferences.</li>
</ul>

<h3>1.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
<p>When you visit our Site, we automatically collect certain information about your device and browsing activity:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, and device identifiers.</li>
  <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages viewed, time spent on pages, click patterns, and referral URLs.</li>
  <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> General geographic location (country, state, city) derived from IP address.</li>
  <li><strong>Cookies and Similar Technologies:</strong> See our Cookie Policy below.</li>
</ul>

<h3>1.3 Information from Third Parties</h3>
<p>We may receive information about you from third parties, including payment processors (Shopify Payments, PayPal), shipping carriers (FedEx, UPS, USPS), analytics providers (Google Analytics), and social media platforms.</p>

