  <li>Monitor site security, fraud prevention, and operational integrity.</li>
</ul>

<h3>2.4 Legal Compliance</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Comply with federal, California state, and local legal obligations (e.g. tax reporting).</li>
  <li>Enforce our Terms of Service and protect our legal rights.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR)</h2>
<p>If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA) or the United Kingdom, we process your personal information under the following legal bases:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Contract:</strong> Processing necessary to fulfill our contract with you (order processing and fulfillment).</li>
  <li><strong>Consent:</strong> Your explicit consent for specific purposes (such as promotional emails).</li>
  <li><strong>Legitimate Interests:</strong> Our legitimate commercial interests (Site improvement, fraud prevention).</li>
  <li><strong>Legal Obligation:</strong> Compliance with applicable laws and accounting regulations.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. How We Share Your Information</h2>
<p>We may share your personal information with trusted service providers necessary for store operations:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Shopify:</strong> Our e-commerce platform provider.</li>
  <li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> Shopify Payments and PayPal for secure transaction clearing.</li>
  <li><strong>Shipping Carriers:</strong> FedEx, UPS, and USPS for order delivery and signature verification.</li>
  <li><strong>Analytics Providers:</strong> Google Analytics for aggregate website analytics.</li>
</ul>

